OL,3,GNEWSACharity donates #150k to lung
OL,4,Acancer research
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Guernsey trust has donated #150,000
OL,7,Ffor research into lung cancer diagnosis
OL,8,Fresearch at the University of
OL,9,FSouthampton.
OL,11,FThe money from the Jon Moulton Charity
OL,12,FTrust will help assess whether people
OL,13,Fwho have not responded to NHS requests
OL,14,Fto go for a lung cancer screening,
OL,15,Fwould instead return a urine sample
OL,16,Fwhich could be used to test for cancer.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
