OL,3,GNEWSACharity donates #150k to lung
OL,4,Acancer research
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Victoria Goss from the Southampton
OL,7,FClinical Trials Unit (SCTU), said:
OL,8,F"Earlier diagnosis can improve outcomes
OL,9,Ffor patients, but detecting lung cancer
OL,10,Fat its earliest stages can be
OL,11,Fdifficult, as symptoms can be vague."
OL,13,FJon Moulton said: "We are pleased to
OL,14,Fsupport this study, which could help
OL,15,Fmore people access important screening
OL,16,Ffor lung cancer."
